{
    "id": "agenda-myday@beatlink",
    "name": "Agenda My Day",
    "description": "The My Day widget from agenda@beatlink, split out as its own addon: a note-detail focus panel that appears only while you're browsing your My Day note. It carries a countdown timer with selectable durations and start/select/end sounds, files tasks into the My Day note as their start time arrives, and sends a desktop notification as each task comes due. Owns its own settings note (myDaySchema.json/myDayConfig.json) tagged #agendaMyDayConfig - the My Day note, timer sounds, and the two due-task toggles - independent of agenda@beatlink's #agendaConfig. The two due-task loops resolve their task list from agenda's active profile and its start/due label vocabulary, so this addon clones in agenda's overview/query/config libraries and its settings reader; when agenda@beatlink isn't installed those loops stay off and the countdown timer still works on its own.",
    "author": "BeatLink",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/BeatLink/trilium-scripts/tree/main/addons/agenda-myday@beatlink",
    "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later",
    "latestVersion": "1.0.0",
    "type": "widget",
    "readme": "README.md",
